{"t":"AA","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Alcoa Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Aluminum","employees":14900,"hq":"Pittsburgh, PA, United States","website":"https://www.alcoa.com","summary_en":"Alcoa Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the bauxite mining, alumina refining, aluminum production, and energy generation business in Australia, Brazil, Canada, Iceland, Norway, Spain, the United States, and internationally. The company operates through two segments: Alumina and Aluminum. It operates bauxite and other aluminous ores mining and processes bauxite into alumina for sale to aluminum smelter customers and customers who process it into industrial chemical products through supply contracts to third parties, as well as aluminum smelting and casting businesses. The company also offers aluminium powder and scrap and primary aluminum in the form of commodity grade ingot and value-add ingot to customers that produce products for transportation, building and construction, packaging, wire, and other industrial markets. In addition, it provides energy that generates and sells electricity in the wholesale market to traders, large industrial consumers, distribution companies, and other generation companies. The company was formerly known as Alcoa Upstream Corporation and changed its name to Alcoa Corporation in May 2016. The company was founded in 1886 and is headquartered in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Alcoa Corporation은 자회사와 함께 호주, 브라질, 캐나다, 아이슬란드, 노르웨이, 스페인, 미국 및 국제적으로 보크사이트 채굴, 알루미나 정제, 알루미늄 생산 및 에너지 발전 사업에 참여하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 알루미나와 알루미늄이라는 두 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 보크사이트 및 기타 알루미늄 광석 채굴을 운영하고 보크사이트를 알루미나로 가공하여 알루미늄 제련소 고객과 이를 제3자 공급 계약을 통해 산업용 화학 제품으로 처리하는 고객과 알루미늄 제련 및 주조 사업체에 판매합니다. 또한 회사는 운송, 건축 및 건설, 포장, 전선 및 기타 산업 시장용 제품을 생산하는 고객에게 알루미늄 분말 및 스크랩과 일차 알루미늄을 상품 등급 주괴 및 부가가치 주괴 형태로 제공합니다. 또한, 도매시장에서 전력을 생산하고 판매하는 에너지를 거래자, 대규모 산업소비자, 유통업체, 기타 발전회사에 공급합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Alcoa Upstream Corporation으로 알려졌으며 2016년 5월에 Alcoa Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1886년에 설립되었으며 펜실베니아주 피츠버그에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":39.32,"mcap":10379295744.0,"pe":6.8382607,"fpe":7.548242,"peg":null,"ps":0.7252163,"pb":1.2588443,"ev_ebitda":3.88,"div":0.99,"beta":1.839,"hi52":84.38,"lo52":35.12},"fin":{"rev":14311999488.0,"rev_g":0.237,"eps_g":1.057,"gross":0.22757,"op":0.15274,"net":0.106759995,"roe":0.20577998,"fcf":918625024.0,"cash":4408000000.0,"debt":4822000128.0,"de":58.484,"eps":5.75,"feps":5.20916},"own":{"short":0.0475,"inst":0.82658994,"insider":0.0051599997},"analyst":{"n":13,"mean":54.59231,"median":55.0,"high":63.0,"low":48.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.92857,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":7,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":7,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":8,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":8,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"Argus Research","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"","currentPriceTarget":0.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":56.0,"priorPriceTarget":76.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"B. Riley Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":63.0,"priorPriceTarget":80.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Freedom Broker","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":62.0,"priorPriceTarget":76.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-14","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":55.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-07","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","